	(text "Connection for a COMPLETE 2.2-inch ILI9341 SPI module, not a bare panel.\nPROVISIONAL: J3 pin order follows the module pin list given by the team. Confirm against the actual module.\nLED pin is switched high-side by Q2 (P-FET), driven by Q1 from PWM. Keeps active-high PWM in firmware.\nR52 is a series link for backlight current; change only if the module has no LED resistor.\nR50/R51 damp the 75 MHz SPI edges. Keep this net short."
